    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f914beb46b625143f53878",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "《荒漠英雄传说》──这是我们从她出道前\n就开始动笔的日记，她的轨迹纪录，\n也是世界上独一无二的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7acfa497dc270aeec54446141c2760174d0174a5a478ded4fa525ba83dbce20a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
