    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbc0a9675cff84b4a177fa17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……你想写什么？我看看……\n“荒漠英雄”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "aceac50baedfc848974abd1813d7baecc81f4eda7e315d23807749ef6e3dce1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b78e785b7199e7ea4251cb40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“荒漠英雄以强劲的步伐踢着赛道，\n她坚持跑在笔直的道路上，完全不负英雄之名。\n无人能够追上她。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b18a8aeed7e55d53cac5e441eafe979832f9ec09b6cabc938cf4e0ae35bae08",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcb93367bcd32a22429e03ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“最后……她戴上荣耀的王冠，\n获得了只属于自己的剑，\n那把剑丝毫不输给她最崇拜的英雄罗布・罗伊。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "d904e5838bfe9280ae08b981c8ae77b15d02eeb80bdb1e8b2c607c0f81be57ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1047/storytimeline_501047202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33103bb3da7eabdba5d2d425",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你在现实中也会变得无敌喔",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae52d8ade6223d35376bbf5415cf6d772e35fe42970e77133765dea1d49deccf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
